### Pictures of muon trident events in the TOF-meter, as PNG files (batch)
###   ./TOFmeter --preinit macro/physics_tridents.mac macro/vis_tridents.mac
### Cosmic muons above 0.85 GeV (no trident below) from the scan plane, tridents made 10^5 times
### more often. The run keeps the first tridentMax events with a detectable trident (all three muons
### cross the top and the middle TOF; tridentKeep 1 keeps every trident event) and then stops. Each
### kept event is drawn twice by macro/vis_trident_event.mac: output/trident_views/trident_view_<n>.png with n = 2k
### (oblique) and 2k + 1 (side view) for kept event k; trident_view_1.png is the empty detector. Only muon tracks are drawn, mu- red and mu+ blue; lead, plates and beams are wireframe. The
### log line "Kept trident event ..." of each event gives its energies, vertex and the TOF bars of
### the three muons. To look at them in the Qt GUI instead: macro/vis_tridents_qt.mac.

/control/alias tridentKeep 2
/control/alias tridentMax 20

/control/verbose 2
/vis/open TSG_OFFSCREEN
/vis/tsg/offscreen/set/size 1400 1050
/control/shell mkdir -p output/trident_views
/vis/tsg/offscreen/set/file auto output/trident_views/trident_view_
/vis/viewer/set/autoRefresh false
/vis/drawVolume
/vis/geometry/set/visibility WorldLogic 0 false
/vis/geometry/set/forceWireframe AbsorberLogic 0 true
/vis/geometry/set/forceWireframe LeadWallXLogic 0 true
/vis/geometry/set/forceWireframe LeadWallYLogic 0 true
/vis/geometry/set/forceWireframe FrameworkFeLogic 0 true
/vis/geometry/set/forceWireframe FrameworkAlLogic 0 true
/vis/geometry/set/forceWireframe SupportBeamLogic 0 true
/vis/viewer/set/style surface
/vis/viewer/set/background white
/vis/viewer/set/upVector 0 0 1
/vis/viewer/zoomTo 1.1
/vis/scene/add/trajectories smooth
/vis/modeling/trajectories/create/drawByParticleID
/vis/modeling/trajectories/drawByParticleID-0/set mu- red
/vis/modeling/trajectories/drawByParticleID-0/set mu+ blue
/vis/modeling/trajectories/drawByParticleID-0/default/setLineWidth 2
/vis/filtering/trajectories/create/particleFilter
/vis/filtering/trajectories/particleFilter-0/add mu-
/vis/filtering/trajectories/particleFilter-0/add mu+
/vis/scene/add/eventID

/process/em/setBiasingFactor muToMuonPairProd 1e5 true
/run/physicsModified
/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 3
/OutputDirectory output
/OutputFile vis_tridents
/gun/seed 6161
/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 42 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX 100 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY 100 cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 75 deg
/tof/cosmic/energyMin 0.85 GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax 1000 GeV
/tof/tridents/keepForVis {tridentKeep}
/tof/tridents/maxKept {tridentMax}

# no drawing while running; the kept events are drawn afterwards
/vis/disable
/run/beamOn 2000000
/vis/enable
/vis/reviewKeptEvents macro/vis_trident_event.mac
